    "categories": ["women", "women-clothing-jeans"],
    "tags": ["jeans", "denim", "aw26"],
    "description": {
      "values": [
        {
          "locale": "en-US",
          "value": "A flare that starts at the knee rather than the thigh, so it still reads as jeans and not costume. High rise, mid wash denim with a subtle fade, traditional five-pocket construction. Sizes 8 to 20, machine washable."
        },
        {
          "locale": "en-GB",
          "value": "A flare that starts at the knee rather than the thigh, so it still reads as jeans and not costume. High rise, mid wash denim with a subtle fade, traditional five-pocket construction. Sizes 8 to 20, machine washable."
        },
        {
          "locale": "es-ES",
          "value": "Un acampanado que empieza en la rodilla y no en el muslo, para que siga siendo un vaquero y no un disfraz. Tiro alto, denim de lavado medio con un desgaste sutil y la construcción clásica de cinco bolsillos. Tallas de la 8 a la 20, lavable a máquina."
        },
        {
          "locale": "fr-FR",
          "value": "Un évasé qui commence au genou plutôt qu'à la cuisse, pour rester un jean et pas un costume. Taille haute, denim délavage moyen légèrement passé, construction cinq poches traditionnelle. Tailles 8 à 20, lavable en machine."
        },
        {
          "locale": "de-DE",
          "value": "Ein Schlag, der am Knie beginnt statt am Oberschenkel – so bleibt es eine Jeans und kein Kostüm. Hoher Bund, Denim in mittlerer Waschung mit dezentem Fade-Effekt, klassische Five-Pocket-Verarbeitung. Größen 8 bis 20, maschinenwaschbar."
        },
        {
          "locale": "it-IT",
          "value": "Una zampa che parte dal ginocchio e non dalla coscia, così resta un jeans e non un costume. Vita alta, denim lavaggio medio con una leggera sfumatura, classica costruzione a cinque tasche. Taglie dalla 8 alla 20, lavabili in lavatrice."
        }
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "schema": "http://bigcontent.io/cms/schema/v1/core#/definitions/localized-value"
      }
    }
